<title>USA: TABLE-A.T. Cross cuts qtly div to $0.08/shr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-A.T. Cross cuts qtly div to $0.08/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLN, R.I. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.08		     $0.16</p>
<p> Pay		    Aug 19</p>
<p> Record		  Aug 5</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is A.T. Cross Co.</p>
<p>Note: The company said the reduction in the dividend reflects &quot;the current state of the quality writing instrument market&quot; and its plan to increase marketing investments in Europe and other markets.</p>
<p>The reduction is also to support initiatives of its Pen Computing Group.</p>
</text>
